    "horizontalBasis": "Exact-QID cathedral parent plus cloister roof/court and two surrounding monastery parent plans. Secondary massing is the union of monastery parents minus cathedral/cloister footprints. Full complex is centered while retaining geographic positions;original cathedral identity is70.16m from the new anchor.",
